     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements CreateSecureChannel</b></p><a name=\"CreateSecureChannel\"> </a><a name=\"hcCreateSecureChannel\"> </a><p>These requirements apply to the following actors: </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-VHLReceiver.html\">VHL Receiver</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-VHLSharer.html\">VHL Sharer</a></li></ul><p>These requirements derive from <a href=\"Requirements-EstablishTrust.html\">Establish Trust</a></p><table class=\"grid\"/></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
